flowchart LR
    C[Capsule C] --> V[Validate signature, predecessor, nonce]
    V --> R[Collect compatible WitnessReceipts]
    R --> Q{Quorum Q satisfied?}
    Q -- No --> A[AbandonProof or pending]
    Q -- Yes --> CP[ClosureProof]
    CP --> X[Deterministic execution]
    X --> SR[Successor state root]
    SR --> SS[StateSeal]
    SS --> AL[Atomic persist and audit event]
